    "commit": "4348999cd3c2e20c49615e9af7c6bbb45b64cd85"
  },
  "rule": "per label, the lowest grid threshold with action precision >= 0.7 (gold-touching spans / spans, scored labels of contract v2), fewer than 0.05 flags per development-negative document (op-B) and at most 1 flag per 1,024 development-negative documents (the Stage A acceptance bar, the binding one), the other labels held at op-B; a label no threshold qualifies is left out; the joint point must stay within 1 per 1,024",
  "rule_note": "op-B's bar alone chose DATE_OF_BIRTH 0.75, which flagged 42 of 978 development negatives; the acceptance bar is applied on development data only",
